hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"74","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahid bin Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waail bin Dawood al-Laisi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Abi Habib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Umar ne mujh se kaha: tum kin logon mein se ho? Maine kaha: Tameem ki Taim shakh se. Unhon ne kaha: unhi mein se ya un ke mawaliyon mein se? Maine kaha: un ke mawaliyon mein se. Unhon ne kaha: to tum ne aisa kyun na kaha keh un ke mawaliyon mein se ho?"
"75","Amr bin Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Usman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail bin Ubaid ne apne walid Ubaid se, unhon ne Rifa'a bin Rafi' se mujhe bataya keh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Umar raziyallahu anhu se kaha: apni qaum ko mere paas jama karo. Unhon ne unhein jama kiya; jab woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke darwaze par hazir hue, Umar andar gaye aur kaha: maine aap ke liye apni qaum jama kar di hai. Ansaar ne yeh suna to kaha: Quraish ke baare mein wahi nazil hui hai. Sunne aur dekhne wale aa gaye. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam bahar aaye aur un ke darmiyan khade ho kar kaha: kya tumhare darmiyan tum mein se ghair koi hai? Unhon ne kaha: haan, hamare darmiyan hamara haleef (muahid dost), hamari behan ka beta aur hamare mawali hain. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kaha: hamara haleef hum mein se hai, hamari behan ka beta hum mein se hai, aur hamare mawali hum mein se hain. Aur sun lo: tum mein se mere dost muttaqi log hain; agar tum wohi ho to achha, warna khabardar raho — Qayamat ke din log aamaal le kar aayenge aur tum bojh le kar aaoge, to tum se munh pher liya jayega. Phir unhon ne pukara: aye logo! Aur apne dono haath uthakar Quraish ke saron par rakhe. Aye logo! Quraish amanatdar log hain; jo un par zulm karega — Zuhair kehte hain: mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: fasad karne walon — Allah use naak ke bal gira dega. Unhon ne yeh baat teen baar kahi."
